# The built native library IS tracked: app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libtsbridge_jni.so
# is what makes a fresh clone buildable without a Rust toolchain. It is built in
# the tsbridge checkout (`./tools/build-android.ps1 -Sync`) and committed alongside
# the version of tsbridge that produced it.
